{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kWWEyE215V1793228010.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>谷歌母公司Alphabet第三季度業績大致符合市場預期，但自由現金流負值擴大至90億美元，股價在延長交易時段曾跌約一成。</p><p></p><p>公司季內賺261.7億美元，按年倒退兩成半。每股攤薄盈利2.12美元，減少兩成六。</p><p></p><p>收入則增長兩成四，至1,275億美元。當中雲端業務收入錄得創季度紀錄的307億美元，增長超過一倍。Youtube廣告收入112億美元，增長百分之9。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.470425+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:18:09.469553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:38:13.684799+00:00","content_hash":"fb14272dd1424848e9486b6c88921c20e096d537694b822ee829d05b20c55615","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.470425+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}